  "FROG": "",
  "Looming detectors LPLC2/LC4 (and so DNp01) as it hops closer and the tongue shoots out; a capture fires body, head and leg touch neurons. The frog's behaviour is a game rule.": "",
  "Looming detectors LPLC2/LC4 as it dives; a grab fires leg, wing and body touch neurons. It only hunts a fly that is in the air. The chase is a game rule.": "",
  "Looming detectors LPLC2/LC4: the slow creep stays below the looming threshold, the strike does not; a capture fires body and leg touch neurons. The creep and strike are game rules.": "",
